{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/4aa9b39508c3ad5ff7f3dd0ad19e1e03.poster.avif?t=1768902542\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/4aa9b39508c3ad5ff7f3dd0ad19e1e03.webm?t=1768902542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/4aa9b39508c3ad5ff7f3dd0ad19e1e03.mp4?t=1768902542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 Toxoplasma is a First Person Sci-Fi Horror game set on an abandoned space station where you're developing a bio-weapon designed to end humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 DETECT ANOMALIES: <strong>Identify anomalies</strong> before your hallucinations become fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 DEVELOP: Progress your bio-weapon research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 SURVIVE: Distinguish reality from demonic hallucinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 UNCOVER: Piece together the conspiracy behind your mission through scattered evidence and radio transmissions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 DECIDE: Your choices shape multiple endings, including a hidden ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588\u00a0The infection manifests differently each playthrough. No two experiences are identical, ensuring a terrifying experience for newcomers and veterans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. A rise of violence and misanthropy ravages the Earth, but your space station is not safe either. Every day you work towards a bio-weapon made to wipe out humanity in the most brutal way possible. Anyone who is contaminated hallucinates demonic entities that torment them until they die. You must complete its development before your hallucinations kill you. You must figure out why you are trapped here.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050580?t=1768902542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050580?t=1768902542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/e7631cb6aa272ea5a205e6fd3621020ec6167a58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768902542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/e7631cb6aa272ea5a205e6fd3621020ec6167a58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768902542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/4aa9b39508c3ad5ff7f3dd0ad19e1e03.poster.avif?t=1768902542\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/4aa9b39508c3ad5ff7f3dd0ad19e1e03.webm?t=1768902542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/4aa9b39508c3ad5ff7f3dd0ad19e1e03.mp4?t=1768902542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 Toxoplasma is a First Person Sci-Fi Horror game set on an abandoned space station where you're developing a bio-weapon designed to end humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 DETECT ANOMALIES: <strong>Identify anomalies</strong> before your hallucinations become fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 DEVELOP: Progress your bio-weapon research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 SURVIVE: Distinguish reality from demonic hallucinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 UNCOVER: Piece together the conspiracy behind your mission through scattered evidence and radio transmissions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 DECIDE: Your choices shape multiple endings, including a hidden ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588\u00a0The infection manifests differently each playthrough. No two experiences are identical, ensuring a terrifying experience for newcomers and veterans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. A rise of violence and misanthropy ravages the Earth, but your space station is not safe either. Every day you work towards a bio-weapon made to wipe out humanity in the most brutal way possible. Anyone who is contaminated hallucinates demonic entities that torment them until they die. You must complete its development before your hallucinations kill you. You must figure out why you are trapped here.</p>","developers":["SimmeringConcrete"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/e3300aadccb2ce21a934e5747e1417c075f7815f/header.jpg?t=1768902542","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4050580/535068236/bafd39e42505eb6059ab79b8b9687b2092eb4da9/1767935306